{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026y9J4HGTCI31794693960.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：廣東沿岸風勢微弱，天色大致良好。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致天晴。日間乾燥，最高氣溫約27度。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。</p><p></p><p>展望：未來一兩日雲量較多，但明日風勢較大。星期三北風增強，稍後氣溫顯著下降。本週後期早晚普遍清涼。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T22:52:11.018202+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T04:28:55.079585+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T22:45:17.559020+00:00","content_hash":"c817c99ac1c6e50ee7a0571c4c738668f216f26dac218d0100151d93f92eba20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T22:52:11.018202+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}